{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──いよいよ決勝だな","trans":"——终于到决赛了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011003070010","name":"樹里","text":"……ん、だな","trans":"……嗯，是啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"緊張してるか？","trans":"紧张吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011003070020","name":"樹里","text":"んー……まあまあ、かな","trans":"嗯——……还行吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……樹里、\r\n今日のステージ、楽しんでこいよ","trans":"……树里\n今天的舞台，去好好享受吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"それから、\r\n怪我にだけは気を付けてくれ","trans":"还有\n千万注意别受伤","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011003070030","name":"樹里","text":"はは、ここでそれ言うのかよ……！","trans":"哈哈，这种时候说这个吗……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"自信、持っていけ\r\n樹里なら大丈夫","trans":"拿出自信来\n树里的话没问题","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……サイッコーの笑顔、期待してるぞ！","trans":"……期待你最棒的笑容！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6011003070040","name":"樹里","text":"──ああ、任せとけ！","trans":"——嗯，交给我吧！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}